sequenceDiagram
    participant Comp as Component\n(uses hook)
    participant Hook as useDocumentTitle.js
    participant Browser as Browser

    Comp->>Hook: Call hook('About')
    Hook->>Browser: useEffect runs
    Browser->>Browser: document.title = "OXIGEN | About"
    Browser->>Browser: window.scrollTo(0, 0)

    Note over Hook: Dependency: [pageName]\nReruns only when pageName changes

    Comp->>Hook: Re-render with 'Home'
    Hook->>Browser: useEffect runs again
    Browser->>Browser: document.title = "OXIGEN"
    Browser->>Browser: window.scrollTo(0, 0)

    Note over Comp: Component unmounts
    Note over Hook: Cleanup runs (if any)
